(803,865,$mw$9A5D7AEC01E59DEFFE071D19FEE470234DE19757786C2A0A120A600435FDD507$mw$,$mw$c730005f043d3ad4a4d706d5124573b6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":865,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل معادلة تفاضلية من الدرجة الثانية بشرطي بداية","TitleEn":"Solve a second-order IVP at a specific point","QuestionTextAr":"حل y''+y=0 مع y(0)=0 وy'(0)=2. ما قيمة y(π/2)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Solve y''+y=0 with y(0)=0 and y'(0)=2. What is y(π/2)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"الحل y=Acos x+Bsin x. من y(0)=0 يكون A=0، ومن y'(0)=2 يكون B=2، إذن y(π/2)=2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"The solution is y=A cos x+B sin x. Initial conditions give A=0 and B=2, so y(π/2)=2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3453,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3454,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3455,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3456,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\pi","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اكتب المعادلة المميزة للمعادلة التفاضلية.","En":"Write the characteristic equation of the differential equation."},{"Ar":"استعمل الحل المثلثي العام ثم طبّق شرطي الدالة ومشتقتها عند الصفر.","En":"Use the general trigonometric solution, then apply both initial conditions at zero."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل معادلة تفاضلية من الدرجة الثانية بشرطي بداية","En":"Solve a second-order IVP at a specific point"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0 قيمة البداية فقط.","En":"Zero is only the initial value."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 يهمل معامل الجيب 2.","En":"One omits the sine coefficient two."}},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\pi","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"π ليس قيمة الجيب المضروب في 2 عند π/2.","En":"Pi is not twice the sine at pi/2."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"حل y''+y=0 مع y(0)=0 وy'(0)=2. ما قيمة y(π/2)؟","En":"Solve y''+y=0 with y(0)=0 and y'(0)=2. What is y(π/2)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حل المعادلة التفاضلية الخطية $y''+y=0$ من المعادلة المميزة $r^2+1=0$، والجذور $r=\\pm i$.","En":"For the linear ODE $y''+y=0$, the characteristic equation $r^2+1=0$ has roots $r=\\pm i$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الجذران ±i يعطيان الحل المثلثي العام.","En":"Roots ±i give the general trigonometric solution."},{"Ar":"$y=A\\cos x+B\\sin x$","En":"$y=A\\cos x+B\\sin x$"},{"Ar":"نعوض شرطي البداية في الحل ومشتقته فنحصل على A=0 وB=2.","En":"Apply both initial conditions to obtain A=0 and B=2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل شرط المشتقة الابتدائية.","En":"Do not omit the initial derivative condition."},"FormulaLatex":"r^2+1=0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$A=0,\\ B=2,\\ y(\\pi/2)=2$","En":"$A=0,\\ B=2,\\ y(\\pi/2)=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$y''+y=0,\\ y(0)=0,\\ y'(0)=2$","En":"$y''+y=0,\\ y(0)=0,\\ y'(0)=2$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":69,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اكتب المعادلة المميزة للمعادلة التفاضلية.","En":"Write the characteristic equation of the differential equation."},{"Ar":"استعمل الحل المثلثي العام ثم طبّق شرطي الدالة ومشتقتها عند الصفر.","En":"Use the general trigonometric solution, then apply both initial conditions at zero."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حل المعادلة التفاضلية الخطية $y''+y=0$ من المعادلة المميزة $r^2+1=0$، والجذور $r=\\pm i$.","En":"For the linear ODE $y''+y=0$, the characteristic equation $r^2+1=0$ has roots $r=\\pm i$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الجذران ±i يعطيان الحل المثلثي العام.","En":"Roots ±i give the general trigonometric solution."},{"Ar":"$y=A\\cos x+B\\sin x$","En":"$y=A\\cos x+B\\sin x$"},{"Ar":"نعوض شرطي البداية في الحل ومشتقته فنحصل على A=0 وB=2.","En":"Apply both initial conditions to obtain A=0 and B=2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل شرط المشتقة الابتدائية.","En":"Do not omit the initial derivative condition."},"FormulaLatex":"r^2+1=0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$A=0,\\ B=2,\\ y(\\pi/2)=2$","En":"$A=0,\\ B=2,\\ y(\\pi/2)=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$y''+y=0,\\ y(0)=0,\\ y'(0)=2$","En":"$y''+y=0,\\ y(0)=0,\\ y'(0)=2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0 قيمة البداية فقط.","En":"Zero is only the initial value."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 يهمل معامل الجيب 2.","En":"One omits the sine coefficient two."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"π ليس قيمة الجيب المضروب في 2 عند π/2.","En":"Pi is not twice the sine at pi/2."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$حل المعادلة التفاضلية الخطية $y''+y=0$ من المعادلة المميزة $r^2+1=0$، والجذور $r=\pm i$.

$r^2+1=0$

1. الجذران ±i يعطيان الحل المثلثي العام.

2. $y=A\cos x+B\sin x$

3. نعوض شرطي البداية في الحل ومشتقته فنحصل على A=0 وB=2.

$A=0,\ B=2,\ y(\pi/2)=2$

$2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$y''+y=0,\ y(0)=0,\ y'(0)=2$

لا تهمل شرط المشتقة الابتدائية.$mw$,$mw$For the linear ODE $y''+y=0$, the characteristic equation $r^2+1=0$ has roots $r=\pm i$.

$r^2+1=0$

1. Roots ±i give the general trigonometric solution.

2. $y=A\cos x+B\sin x$

3. Apply both initial conditions to obtain A=0 and B=2.

$A=0,\ B=2,\ y(\pi/2)=2$

$2$ Dimensionless

$y''+y=0,\ y(0)=0,\ y'(0)=2$

Do not omit the initial derivative condition.$mw$),
(804,866,$mw$7413E5D7B32650E0FB4598A9755F4E1E5DB174A10CCE51B4BA31ABC76D6FCC57$mw$,$mw$59885f158707c2bff10e52f65df4d9fb$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":866,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل معادلة تفاضلية خطية غير متجانسة","TitleEn":"Solve a nonhomogeneous linear ODE using an integrating factor","QuestionTextAr":"تحقق y المعادلة y'+y=2 مع y(0)=0. ما y(ln 2)؟","QuestionTextEn":"A function satisfies y'+y=2 and y(0)=0. Find y(ln 2).","DetailedSolutionAr":"بضرب المعادلة في e^x نحصل على (e^x y)'=2e^x. بالتكامل y=2+Ce^(−x)، ومن شرط البداية C=−2؛ عند x=ln2 نجد y=2−2×(1/2)=1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Multiplying by e^x gives (e^x y)'=2e^x. Thus y=2+Ce^(−x). Since y(0)=0, C=−2, and y(ln2)=2−2/2=1.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3393,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3394,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3395,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3396,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"هذه معادلة تفاضلية خطية من الرتبة الأولى.","En":"This is a first-order linear ODE."},{"Ar":"اضرب الطرفين في عامل التكامل e^x ثم كامل وطبّق الشرط الابتدائي قبل التعويض.","En":"Multiply by the integrating factor e^x, integrate, and apply the initial condition before substituting."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل معادلة تفاضلية خطية غير متجانسة","En":"Solve a nonhomogeneous linear ODE using an integrating factor"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0 قيمة البداية فقط.","En":"Zero is only the initial value."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 نهاية الحل عند اللانهاية لا قيمته المطلوبة.","En":"Two is the limit at infinity, not the requested value."}},{"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 لا يتفق مع الحل 2−2e^(−x).","En":"Four disagrees with the solution 2−2e^(−x)."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"تحقق y المعادلة y'+y=2 مع y(0)=0. ما y(ln 2)؟","En":"A function satisfies y'+y=2 and y(0)=0. Find y(ln 2)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحل المعادلة الخطية من الرتبة الأولى بعامل التكامل.","En":"Solve the first-order linear ODE using an integrating factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب في عامل التكامل ونكامل الطرفين.","En":"Multiply by the integrating factor and integrate both sides."},{"Ar":"$y=2+Ce^{-x}$","En":"$y=2+Ce^{-x}$"},{"Ar":"من y(0)=0 نجد C=−2 ثم نعوض ln 2 حيث العامل الأسي نصف.","En":"From y(0)=0 find C=−2; at ln 2 the exponential factor is one half."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$1$","En":"$1$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"عيّن ثابت التكامل قبل التعويض.","En":"Determine the integration constant before evaluation."},"FormulaLatex":"(e^xy)'=2e^x","Substitution":{"Ar":"$C=-2,\\ y(\\ln2)=2-2/2=1$","En":"$C=-2,\\ y(\\ln2)=2-2/2=1$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$y'+y=2e^{-x}+2-2e^{-x}=2,\\ y(0)=0$","En":"$y'+y=2e^{-x}+2-2e^{-x}=2,\\ y(0)=0$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":68,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"هذه معادلة تفاضلية خطية من الرتبة الأولى.","En":"This is a first-order linear ODE."},{"Ar":"اضرب الطرفين في عامل التكامل e^x ثم كامل وطبّق الشرط الابتدائي قبل التعويض.","En":"Multiply by the integrating factor e^x, integrate, and apply the initial condition before substituting."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحل المعادلة الخطية من الرتبة الأولى بعامل التكامل.","En":"Solve the first-order linear ODE using an integrating factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب في عامل التكامل ونكامل الطرفين.","En":"Multiply by the integrating factor and integrate both sides."},{"Ar":"$y=2+Ce^{-x}$","En":"$y=2+Ce^{-x}$"},{"Ar":"من y(0)=0 نجد C=−2 ثم نعوض ln 2 حيث العامل الأسي نصف.","En":"From y(0)=0 find C=−2; at ln 2 the exponential factor is one half."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$1$","En":"$1$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"عيّن ثابت التكامل قبل التعويض.","En":"Determine the integration constant before evaluation."},"FormulaLatex":"(e^xy)'=2e^x","Substitution":{"Ar":"$C=-2,\\ y(\\ln2)=2-2/2=1$","En":"$C=-2,\\ y(\\ln2)=2-2/2=1$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$y'+y=2e^{-x}+2-2e^{-x}=2,\\ y(0)=0$","En":"$y'+y=2e^{-x}+2-2e^{-x}=2,\\ y(0)=0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0 قيمة البداية فقط.","En":"Zero is only the initial value."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 نهاية الحل عند اللانهاية لا قيمته المطلوبة.","En":"Two is the limit at infinity, not the requested value."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 لا يتفق مع الحل 2−2e^(−x).","En":"Four disagrees with the solution 2−2e^(−x)."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نحل المعادلة الخطية من الرتبة الأولى بعامل التكامل.

$(e^xy)'=2e^x$

1. نضرب في عامل التكامل ونكامل الطرفين.

2. $y=2+Ce^{-x}$

3. من y(0)=0 نجد C=−2 ثم نعوض ln 2 حيث العامل الأسي نصف.

$C=-2,\ y(\ln2)=2-2/2=1$

$1$ بلا وحدة محددة

$y'+y=2e^{-x}+2-2e^{-x}=2,\ y(0)=0$

عيّن ثابت التكامل قبل التعويض.$mw$,$mw$Solve the first-order linear ODE using an integrating factor.

$(e^xy)'=2e^x$

1. Multiply by the integrating factor and integrate both sides.

2. $y=2+Ce^{-x}$

3. From y(0)=0 find C=−2; at ln 2 the exponential factor is one half.

$C=-2,\ y(\ln2)=2-2/2=1$

$1$ No specified unit

$y'+y=2e^{-x}+2-2e^{-x}=2,\ y(0)=0$

Determine the integration constant before evaluation.$mw$),
(805,1555,$mw$A4E1D5420F447BAAA50F32320411FE33B12C99894876B90F0286D3E259AF5ED0$mw$,$mw$31a6c60997c526f4e6ee3e3d3d3ca961$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1555,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":81,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"في العدد 462,915، ما قيمة الرقم 6؟","TitleEn":"In 462,915, what is the value of the digit 6?","QuestionTextAr":"في العدد 462,915، ما قيمة الرقم 6؟","QuestionTextEn":"In 462,915, what is the value of the digit 6?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: قيمة الرقم في العدد = الرقم × قيمة منزلته. في العدد 462,915 يقع الرقم 6 في منزلة عشرات الألوف، وقيمة هذه المنزلة 10,000. لذلك قيمة الرقم 6 هي 6 × 10,000 = 60,000. لا نخلط بينها وبين منزلتي الألوف أو المئات.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Place value = digit × value of its position. In 462,915, the digit 6 occupies the ten-thousands position. Thus its value is 6 × 10,000 = 60,000. It represents sixty thousand, not six thousand or six hundred.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6209,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6,000","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6210,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"600","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6211,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"60,000","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6212,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"600,000","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"عد المنازل بدءاً من اليمين.","En":"Count positions from the right."},{"Ar":"حدد وزن المنزلة التي يقع فيها الرقم 6 واضربه فيه.","En":"Find the weight of the digit 6's position and multiply."}],"Title":{"Ar":"في العدد 462,915، ما قيمة الرقم 6؟","En":"In 462,915, what is the value of the digit 6?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"6,000","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6000 قيمة الرقم لو كان في الآلاف.","En":"6000 would place it in the thousands."}},{"LatexCode":"600","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"600 قيمة الرقم لو كان في المئات.","En":"600 would place it in the hundreds."}},{"LatexCode":"60,000","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"600,000","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"600000 قيمة الرقم لو كان في مئات الآلاف.","En":"600000 would place it in the hundred-thousands."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"في العدد 462,915، ما قيمة الرقم 6؟","En":"In 462,915, what is the value of the digit 6?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة المكانية تساوي الرقم مضروباً في وزن منزلته.","En":"Place value is the digit times the value of its position."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نعد المنازل بدءاً من الآحاد؛ الرقم 6 يقع في منزلة عشرات الآلاف.","En":"Count from the ones place; digit six is in the ten-thousands place."},{"Ar":"$462915=400000+60000+2000+900+10+5$","En":"$462915=400000+60000+2000+900+10+5$"},{"Ar":"نضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته 10000.","En":"Multiply the digit by its place weight 10000."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$60{,}000$","En":"$60{,}000$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الرقم بقيمته المكانية.","En":"Do not confuse the digit with its place value."},"FormulaLatex":"V=d\\cdot10^k","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6\\cdot10^4=60000$","En":"$6\\cdot10^4=60000$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$60000/10000=6$","En":"$60000/10000=6$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":81,"PrimarySkillId":305,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"عد المنازل بدءاً من اليمين.","En":"Count positions from the right."},{"Ar":"حدد وزن المنزلة التي يقع فيها الرقم 6 واضربه فيه.","En":"Find the weight of the digit 6's position and multiply."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة المكانية تساوي الرقم مضروباً في وزن منزلته.","En":"Place value is the digit times the value of its position."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نعد المنازل بدءاً من الآحاد؛ الرقم 6 يقع في منزلة عشرات الآلاف.","En":"Count from the ones place; digit six is in the ten-thousands place."},{"Ar":"$462915=400000+60000+2000+900+10+5$","En":"$462915=400000+60000+2000+900+10+5$"},{"Ar":"نضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته 10000.","En":"Multiply the digit by its place weight 10000."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$60{,}000$","En":"$60{,}000$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الرقم بقيمته المكانية.","En":"Do not confuse the digit with its place value."},"FormulaLatex":"V=d\\cdot10^k","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6\\cdot10^4=60000$","En":"$6\\cdot10^4=60000$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$60000/10000=6$","En":"$60000/10000=6$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6000 قيمة الرقم لو كان في الآلاف.","En":"6000 would place it in the thousands."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"600 قيمة الرقم لو كان في المئات.","En":"600 would place it in the hundreds."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"600000 قيمة الرقم لو كان في مئات الآلاف.","En":"600000 would place it in the hundred-thousands."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القيمة المكانية تساوي الرقم مضروباً في وزن منزلته.

$V=d\cdot10^k$

1. نعد المنازل بدءاً من الآحاد؛ الرقم 6 يقع في منزلة عشرات الآلاف.

2. $462915=400000+60000+2000+900+10+5$

3. نضرب الرقم في وزن منزلته 10000.

$6\cdot10^4=60000$

$60{,}000$ بلا وحدة قياس

$60000/10000=6$

لا تخلط الرقم بقيمته المكانية.$mw$,$mw$Place value is the digit times the value of its position.

$V=d\cdot10^k$

1. Count from the ones place; digit six is in the ten-thousands place.

2. $462915=400000+60000+2000+900+10+5$

3. Multiply the digit by its place weight 10000.

$6\cdot10^4=60000$

$60{,}000$ Dimensionless

$60000/10000=6$

Do not confuse the digit with its place value.$mw$),
