543$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف صفر منزلة الآلاف.","En":"Do not drop the zero in the thousands place."},"FormulaLatex":"N=7\\cdot10^4+0\\cdot10^3+5\\cdot10^2+4\\cdot10+3","Substitution":{"Ar":"$N=70543$","En":"$N=70543$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$70543-70000=543$","En":"$70543-70000=543$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"75043 يجعل الخمسة آلافاً.","En":"75043 puts five in thousands."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"70453 يبدل المئات والعشرات.","En":"70453 swaps hundreds and tens."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"70053 يهمل قيمة 500 ويغير العشرات.","En":"70053 omits the value 500 and changes the tens."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الصيغة الموسعة تجمع قيم المنازل المختلفة.

