3. عشر مجموعات تساوي ألفاً؛ أربع مجموعات من عشرة مجموعات تساوي أربعة آلاف.

$4000$

$4{,}000$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4000/100=40$

لا تجمع عدد المجموعات وحجمها.$mw$,$mw$Equal groups total the number of groups times the group size.

$N=40\cdot100$

1. There are forty groups of one hundred.

2. $40\cdot100$

3. Ten groups make one thousand; four sets of ten groups make four thousand.

$4000$

$4{,}000$ Dimensionless

$4000/100=40$

Do not add group count and group size.$mw$),
(813,1563,$mw$22B2FF3BAB79B846031F142D124E70EF04E22DC6EA34FCFDCFCA797265B2DEF1$mw$,$mw$0ce74f4bbe4c02855a3db0d74c06b103$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1563,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"كانت الحرارة −7 درجات ثم ارتفعت 12 درجة. كم أصبحت؟","TitleEn":"The temperature was −7°C and rose by 12°C. What is it now?","QuestionTextAr":"كانت الحرارة −7 درجات ثم ارتفعت 12 درجة. كم أصبحت؟","QuestionTextEn":"The temperature was −7°C and rose by 12°C. What is it now?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: جمع عددين صحيحين مختلفي الإشارة يتم بطرح القيمة المطلقة الأصغر من الأكبر، مع الاحتفاظ بإشارة الأكبر قيمةً مطلقة. البداية −7° والتغير +12°؛ نحسب 12 − 7 = 5، وإشارة العدد 12 موجبة. إذن الحرارة النهائية −7 + 12 = 5 درجات مئوية.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Adding signed integers with different signs means subtracting their absolute values and taking the sign of the number with larger magnitude. The temperature starts at −7°C and rises by 12°C. Since 12 − 7 = 5 and the rise is larger, −7 + 12 = +5°C.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6241,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"−19","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6242,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"−5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6243,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6244,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"19","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"مثّل الارتفاع كحركة نحو اليمين.","En":"Represent a rise as a move to the right."},{"Ar":"ابدأ من الحرارة السالبة وأضف مقدار الارتفاع.","En":"Start at the negative temperature and add the rise."}],"Title":{"Ar":"كانت الحرارة −7 درجات ثم ارتفعت 12 درجة. كم أصبحت؟","En":"The temperature was −7°C and rose by 12°C. What is it now?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"−19","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−19 يمثل انخفاضاً لا ارتفاعاً.","En":"−19 represents a fall, not a rise."}},{"LatexCode":"−5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5 يعكس إشارة الناتج بعد تجاوز الصفر.","En":"−5 reverses the sign after crossing zero."}},{"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"19","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"19 يهمل سالبية البداية.","En":"19 ignores the negative starting value."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"كانت الحرارة −7 درجات ثم ارتفعت 12 درجة. كم أصبحت؟","En":"The temperature was −7°C and rose by 12°C. What is it now?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"ارتفاع الحرارة يمثل إضافة عدد موجب إلى الحرارة الأصلية.","En":"A temperature rise adds a positive change to the original temperature."},"Unit":{"Ar":"درجة مئوية","En":"°C"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الارتفاع تغير موجب؛ نتحرك يميناً من −7 على خط الأعداد.","En":"A rise is positive; move right from −7 on the number line."},{"Ar":"$-7+12$","En":"$-7+12$"},{"Ar":"سبع خطوات تصل للصفر وتبقى خمس خطوات موجبة.","En":"Seven steps reach zero, leaving five positive steps."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"أضف الارتفاع بإشارة موجبة.","En":"Add the rise with positive sign."},"FormulaLatex":"T=T_0+\\Delta T","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5-(-7)=12$","En":"$5-(-7)=12$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":309,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"مثّل الارتفاع كحركة نحو اليمين.","En":"Represent a rise as a move to the right."},{"Ar":"ابدأ من الحرارة السالبة وأضف مقدار الارتفاع.","En":"Start at the negative temperature and add the rise."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"ارتفاع الحرارة يمثل إضافة عدد موجب إلى الحرارة الأصلية.","En":"A temperature rise adds a positive change to the original temperature."},"Unit":{"Ar":"درجة مئوية","En":"°C"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الارتفاع تغير موجب؛ نتحرك يميناً من −7 على خط الأعداد.","En":"A rise is positive; move right from −7 on the number line."},{"Ar":"$-7+12$","En":"$-7+12$"},{"Ar":"سبع خطوات تصل للصفر وتبقى خمس خطوات موجبة.","En":"Seven steps reach zero, leaving five positive steps."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"أضف الارتفاع بإشارة موجبة.","En":"Add the rise with positive sign."},"FormulaLatex":"T=T_0+\\Delta T","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5-(-7)=12$","En":"$5-(-7)=12$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−19 يمثل انخفاضاً لا ارتفاعاً.","En":"−19 represents a fall, not a rise."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5 يعكس إشارة الناتج بعد تجاوز الصفر.","En":"−5 reverses the sign after crossing zero."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"19 يهمل سالبية البداية.","En":"19 ignores the negative starting value."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$ارتفاع الحرارة يمثل إضافة عدد موجب إلى الحرارة الأصلية.

$T=T_0+\Delta T$

1. الارتفاع تغير موجب؛ نتحرك يميناً من −7 على خط الأعداد.

2. $-7+12$

3. سبع خطوات تصل للصفر وتبقى خمس خطوات موجبة.

$5$

$5$ درجة مئوية

$5-(-7)=12$

أضف الارتفاع بإشارة موجبة.$mw$,$mw$A temperature rise adds a positive change to the original temperature.

$T=T_0+\Delta T$

1. A rise is positive; move right from −7 on the number line.

2. $-7+12$

3. Seven steps reach zero, leaving five positive steps.

$5$

$5$ °C

$5-(-7)=12$

Add the rise with positive sign.$mw$),
(814,1564,$mw$9E0A73B4E669AC36C3AA1EE3023119AAD188F5CC8A9B71A0E4D72074E44ECBB1$mw$,$mw$0fd13d7d9de57db61c4ec7a52be242cb$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1564,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب −4 − (−9).","TitleEn":"Evaluate −4 − (−9).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب −4 − (−9).","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate −4 − (−9).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: طرح عدد سالب يعادل إضافة موجبه؛ أي أ − (−ب) = أ + ب. لذلك −4 − (−9) = −4 + 9. نجمع عددين مختلفي الإشارة، فنطرح 9 − 4 = 5 ونأخذ الإشارة الموجبة لأن 9 أكبر بالقيمة المطلقة. إذن النتيجة = 5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Subtracting a negative number is equivalent to adding its opposite: a − (−b) = a + b. So −4 − (−9) = −4 + 9. The positive magnitude 9 exceeds 4, and 9 − 4 = 5, giving result +5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6245,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"−13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6246,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6247,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"−5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6248,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارتَي الطرح والسالب.","En":"Notice both subtraction and the negative sign."},{"Ar":"حوّل طرح السالب إلى جمع موجب ثم احسب.","En":"Turn subtraction of a negative into positive addition, then calculate."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب −4 − (−9).","En":"Evaluate −4 − (−9)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"−13","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−13 ينتج من طرح موجب لا سالب.","En":"−13 subtracts a positive rather than a negative."}},{"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"−5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5 يعكس إشارة الناتج.","En":"−5 reverses the result's sign."}},{"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"13 يهمل سالبية العدد الأول.","En":"13 ignores the negative first number."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب −4 − (−9).","En":"Evaluate −4 − (−9)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طرح عدد سالب يكافئ جمع معكوسه.","En":"Subtracting a negative number equals adding its opposite."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طرح −9 يعادل جمع معكوسه +9.","En":"Subtracting −9 equals adding its opposite +9."},{"Ar":"$-4+9$","En":"$-4+9$"},{"Ar":"من −4 نتحرك تسع وحدات يميناً فنصل إلى 5.","En":"Move nine units right from −4 to reach five."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"انتبه لإشارتي الطرح والسالب.","En":"Notice both subtraction and the negative sign."},"FormulaLatex":"a-(-b)=a+b","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5+(-9)=-4$","En":"$5+(-9)=-4$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":309,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارتَي الطرح والسالب.","En":"Notice both subtraction and the negative sign."},{"Ar":"حوّل طرح السالب إلى جمع موجب ثم احسب.","En":"Turn subtraction of a negative into positive addition, then calculate."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طرح عدد سالب يكافئ جمع معكوسه.","En":"Subtracting a negative number equals adding its opposite."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طرح −9 يعادل جمع معكوسه +9.","En":"Subtracting −9 equals adding its opposite +9."},{"Ar":"$-4+9$","En":"$-4+9$"},{"Ar":"من −4 نتحرك تسع وحدات يميناً فنصل إلى 5.","En":"Move nine units right from −4 to reach five."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"انتبه لإشارتي الطرح والسالب.","En":"Notice both subtraction and the negative sign."},"FormulaLatex":"a-(-b)=a+b","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5+(-9)=-4$","En":"$5+(-9)=-4$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−13 ينتج من طرح موجب لا سالب.","En":"−13 subtracts a positive rather than a negative."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5 يعكس إشارة الناتج.","En":"−5 reverses the result's sign."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"13 يهمل سالبية العدد الأول.","En":"13 ignores the negative first number."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$طرح عدد سالب يكافئ جمع معكوسه.

$a-(-b)=a+b$

1. طرح −9 يعادل جمع معكوسه +9.

2. $-4+9$

3. من −4 نتحرك تسع وحدات يميناً فنصل إلى 5.

$5$

$5$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5+(-9)=-4$

انتبه لإشارتي الطرح والسالب.$mw$,$mw$Subtracting a negative number equals adding its opposite.

$a-(-b)=a+b$

1. Subtracting −9 equals adding its opposite +9.

