Notice both subtraction and the negative sign.$mw$),
(815,1565,$mw$34072A6272B0D821D2050361D3118F4F39508B19BB764B3646EC341FA8284877$mw$,$mw$45e51ef58894db81871e0a877984536a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1565,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب (−3)×(−8).","TitleEn":"Evaluate (−3)×(−8).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب (−3)×(−8).","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate (−3)×(−8).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: عند ضرب عددين سالبين يكون الناتج موجباً، لأن إشارتي السالب تتلاشيان في الضرب. نكتب (−3) × (−8) = +(3 × 8). نضرب القيم المطلقة 3 × 8 = 24، وبما أن كلا العاملين سالبان فالنتيجة النهائية +24.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: The product of two negative numbers is positive. First multiply their absolute values: |−3| × |−8| = 3 × 8 = 24. Because both factors are negative, their product is positive, so (−3) × (−8) = 24.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6249,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"−24","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6250,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6251,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"24","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6252,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"−11","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة إشارات الضرب.","En":"Use multiplication sign rules."},{"Ar":"حدد إشارة الناتج أولاً ثم اضرب القيم المطلقة.","En":"Determine the sign first, then multiply the absolute values."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب (−3)×(−8).","En":"Evaluate (−3)×(−8)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"−24","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−24 إشارته خاطئة.","En":"−24 has the wrong sign."}},{"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11 يجمع القيم المطلقة.","En":"Eleven adds the magnitudes."}},{"LatexCode":"24","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"−11","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−11 يجمع المقدارين ويضع إشارة سالبة.","En":"−11 adds magnitudes and gives a negative sign."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب (−3)×(−8).","En":"Evaluate (−3)×(−8)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حاصل ضرب عددين سالبين موجب.","En":"The product of two negative numbers is positive."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العاملان سالبان فيكون الناتج موجباً.","En":"Both factors are negative, so the product is positive."},{"Ar":"$(-3)(-8)=3\\cdot8$","En":"$(-3)(-8)=3\\cdot8$"},{"Ar":"نضرب القيمتين المطلقتين 3 و8.","En":"Multiply magnitudes three and eight."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$24$","En":"$24$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم قاعدة الجمع عند الضرب.","En":"Do not use the addition rule for multiplication."},"FormulaLatex":"(-a)(-b)=ab","Substitution":{"Ar":"$24$","En":"$24$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$24/(-8)=-3$","En":"$24/(-8)=-3$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":309,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة إشارات الضرب.","En":"Use multiplication sign rules."},{"Ar":"حدد إشارة الناتج أولاً ثم اضرب القيم المطلقة.","En":"Determine the sign first, then multiply the absolute values."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حاصل ضرب عددين سالبين موجب.","En":"The product of two negative numbers is positive."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العاملان سالبان فيكون الناتج موجباً.","En":"Both factors are negative, so the product is positive."},{"Ar":"$(-3)(-8)=3\\cdot8$","En":"$(-3)(-8)=3\\cdot8$"},{"Ar":"نضرب القيمتين المطلقتين 3 و8.","En":"Multiply magnitudes three and eight."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$24$","En":"$24$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم قاعدة الجمع عند الضرب.","En":"Do not use the addition rule for multiplication."},"FormulaLatex":"(-a)(-b)=ab","Substitution":{"Ar":"$24$","En":"$24$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$24/(-8)=-3$","En":"$24/(-8)=-3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−24 إشارته خاطئة.","En":"−24 has the wrong sign."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11 يجمع القيم المطلقة.","En":"Eleven adds the magnitudes."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−11 يجمع المقدارين ويضع إشارة سالبة.","En":"−11 adds magnitudes and gives a negative sign."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$حاصل ضرب عددين سالبين موجب.

$(-a)(-b)=ab$

1. العاملان سالبان فيكون الناتج موجباً.

2. $(-3)(-8)=3\cdot8$

3. نضرب القيمتين المطلقتين 3 و8.

$24$

$24$ بلا وحدة قياس

$24/(-8)=-3$

لا تستخدم قاعدة الجمع عند الضرب.$mw$,$mw$The product of two negative numbers is positive.

$(-a)(-b)=ab$

1. Both factors are negative, so the product is positive.

