3. Multiply magnitudes three and eight.

$24$

$24$ Dimensionless

$24/(-8)=-3$

Do not use the addition rule for multiplication.$mw$),
(816,1566,$mw$A92E835943B540A9E64D549295C3C00D850C8FB5953198935001C229A7A103F9$mw$,$mw$88efce9fa1a3d3d12a7a7039a2019fd6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1566,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"رتّب الأعداد −8، −2، 4، 0 تصاعدياً.","TitleEn":"Order −8, −2, 4, 0 from least to greatest.","QuestionTextAr":"رتّب الأعداد −8، −2، 4، 0 تصاعدياً.","QuestionTextEn":"Order −8, −2, 4, 0 from least to greatest.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: في خط الأعداد تكون القيمة الأصغر إلى اليسار؛ والأعداد السالبة أصغر من الصفر، والعدد السالب الأكبر قيمةً مطلقة هو الأصغر. لذا −8 أصغر من −2، وكلاهما أقل من 0، بينما 4 موجب. الترتيب من الأصغر إلى الأكبر هو −8 < −2 < 0 < 4.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: On the number line, values increase from left to right. Any negative number is below zero, and among negatives the number farther from zero has the smaller value. Thus −8 < −2, both precede 0, and +4 is greatest: −8 < −2 < 0 < 4.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6253,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-2<-8<0<4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6254,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-8<-2<0<4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6255,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4<0<-2<-8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6256,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"-8<0<-2<4","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"تخيّل مواضع الأعداد على خط الأعداد، واقرأ من اليسار إلى اليمين.","En":"Place the numbers on a number line and read from left to right."},{"Ar":"رتّب السوالب أولاً. أي العددين السالبين يقع أبعد إلى يسار الصفر؟","En":"Order the negative numbers first. Which of the two lies farther to the left of zero?"}],"Title":{"Ar":"رتّب الأعداد −8، −2، 4، 0 تصاعدياً.","En":"Order −8, −2, 4, 0 from least to greatest."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"-2<-8<0<4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−2 ليس أصغر من −8.","En":"−2 is not smaller than −8."}},{"LatexCode":"-8<-2<0<4","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"4<0<-2<-8","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الترتيب معكوس؛ 4 ليست أصغر من الصفر.","En":"The order is reversed; four is not below zero."}},{"LatexCode":"-8<0<-2<4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الصفر أكبر من −2.","En":"Zero is greater than −2."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"رتّب الأعداد −8، −2، 4، 0 تصاعدياً.","En":"Order −8, −2, 4, 0 from least to greatest."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأعداد تزداد من اليسار إلى اليمين على خط الأعداد.","En":"Values increase from left to right on the number line."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العددان السالبان أصغر من الصفر؛ والصفر أصغر من 4.","En":"Both negatives are below zero, and zero is below four."},{"Ar":"$-8<-2<0<4$","En":"$-8<-2<0<4$"},{"Ar":"بين السالبين يقع −8 أبعد يساراً من −2.","En":"Among the negatives, −8 lies farther left than −2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-8<-2<0<4$","En":"$-8<-2<0<4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا ترتب السوالب تصاعدياً حسب قيمها المطلقة.","En":"Do not order negatives by increasing magnitude."},"FormulaLatex":"a<b\\iff b-a>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-8<-2<0<4$","En":"$-8<-2<0<4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(-2)-(-8)=6,\\quad0-(-2)=2,\\quad4-0=4$","En":"$(-2)-(-8)=6,\\quad0-(-2)=2,\\quad4-0=4$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":307,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"تخيّل مواضع الأعداد على خط الأعداد، واقرأ من اليسار إلى اليمين.","En":"Place the numbers on a number line and read from left to right."},{"Ar":"رتّب السوالب أولاً. أي العددين السالبين يقع أبعد إلى يسار الصفر؟","En":"Order the negative numbers first. Which of the two lies farther to the left of zero?"}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأعداد تزداد من اليسار إلى اليمين على خط الأعداد.","En":"Values increase from left to right on the number line."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العددان السالبان أصغر من الصفر؛ والصفر أصغر من 4.","En":"Both negatives are below zero, and zero is below four."},{"Ar":"$-8<-2<0<4$","En":"$-8<-2<0<4$"},{"Ar":"بين السالبين يقع −8 أبعد يساراً من −2.","En":"Among the negatives, −8 lies farther left than −2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-8<-2<0<4$","En":"$-8<-2<0<4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا ترتب السوالب تصاعدياً حسب قيمها المطلقة.","En":"Do not order negatives by increasing magnitude."},"FormulaLatex":"a<b\\iff b-a>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-8<-2<0<4$","En":"$-8<-2<0<4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(-2)-(-8)=6,\\quad0-(-2)=2,\\quad4-0=4$","En":"$(-2)-(-8)=6,\\quad0-(-2)=2,\\quad4-0=4$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−2 ليس أصغر من −8.","En":"−2 is not smaller than −8."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الترتيب معكوس؛ 4 ليست أصغر من الصفر.","En":"The order is reversed; four is not below zero."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الصفر أكبر من −2.","En":"Zero is greater than −2."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الأعداد تزداد من اليسار إلى اليمين على خط الأعداد.

$a<b\iff b-a>0$

1. العددان السالبان أصغر من الصفر؛ والصفر أصغر من 4.

2. $-8<-2<0<4$

3. بين السالبين يقع −8 أبعد يساراً من −2.

$-8<-2<0<4$

$-8<-2<0<4$ بلا وحدة محددة

$(-2)-(-8)=6,\quad0-(-2)=2,\quad4-0=4$

لا ترتب السوالب تصاعدياً حسب قيمها المطلقة.$mw$,$mw$Values increase from left to right on the number line.

$a<b\iff b-a>0$

1. Both negatives are below zero, and zero is below four.

2. $-8<-2<0<4$

3. Among the negatives, −8 lies farther left than −2.

$-8<-2<0<4$

$-8<-2<0<4$ No specified unit

$(-2)-(-8)=6,\quad0-(-2)=2,\quad4-0=4$

Do not order negatives by increasing magnitude.$mw$),
(817,1567,$mw$6F5773EBEE7D08EF8CA4F07BD9563DAB4CF758911822AA9471CEF3B2BD0D4A33$mw$,$mw$f37e2de2b578a40c4ebddc853b739d78$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1567,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب |−13| − |5|.","TitleEn":"Evaluate |−13| − |5|.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب |−13| − |5|.","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate |−13| − |5|.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: القيمة المطلقة |أ| تمثل المسافة غير السالبة من العدد أ إلى الصفر، لذا |−13| = 13 و|5| = 5. بعد تطبيق القيمة المطلقة نحسب الفرق: 13 − 5 = 8. لا نحافظ على إشارة −13 داخل القيمة المطلقة لأن المسافة لا تكون سالبة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Absolute value |a| is the nonnegative distance of a from zero. Therefore |−13| = 13 and |5| = 5. Apply the absolute values before subtraction: 13 − 5 = 8. The minus sign on −13 does not remain after taking absolute value.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6257,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"−8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6258,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6259,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6260,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"−18","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب القيم المطلقة أولاً.","En":"Evaluate the absolute values first."},{"Ar":"حوّل كل قيمة مطلقة إلى المسافة عن الصفر ثم اطرح.","En":"Replace each absolute value with its distance from zero, then subtract."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب |−13| − |5|.","En":"Evaluate |−13| − |5|."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"−8","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−8 يعكس ترتيب الطرح.","En":"−8 reverses the subtraction order."}},{"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"18 يجمع المسافتين.","En":"Eighteen adds the distances."}},{"LatexCode":"−18","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−18 يهمل القيمة المطلقة للأول.","En":"−18 ignores the first absolute value."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب |−13| − |5|.","En":"Evaluate |−13| − |5|."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة المطلقة مسافة العدد عن الصفر.","En":"Absolute value is distance from zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القيمة المطلقة لـ−13 تساوي 13، ولـ5 تساوي 5.","En":"The absolute values of −13 and five are thirteen and five."},{"Ar":"$|-13|-|5|=13-5$","En":"$|-13|-|5|=13-5$"},{"Ar":"نطرح المسافة الثانية من الأولى.","En":"Subtract the second distance from the first."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"احسب القيم المطلقة قبل الطرح.","En":"Evaluate absolute values before subtraction."},"FormulaLatex":"|-a|=|a|","Substitution":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$8+5=13$","En":"$8+5=13$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":307,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب القيم المطلقة أولاً.","En":"Evaluate the absolute values first."},{"Ar":"حوّل كل قيمة مطلقة إلى المسافة عن الصفر ثم اطرح.","En":"Replace each absolute value with its distance from zero, then subtract."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة المطلقة مسافة العدد عن الصفر.","En":"Absolute value is distance from zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القيمة المطلقة لـ−13 تساوي 13، ولـ5 تساوي 5.","En":"The absolute values of −13 and five are thirteen and five."},{"Ar":"$|-13|-|5|=13-5$","En":"$|-13|-|5|=13-5$"},{"Ar":"نطرح المسافة الثانية من الأولى.","En":"Subtract the second distance from the first."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"احسب القيم المطلقة قبل الطرح.","En":"Evaluate absolute values before subtraction."},"FormulaLatex":"|-a|=|a|","Substitution":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$8+5=13$","En":"$8+5=13$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−8 يعكس ترتيب الطرح.","En":"−8 reverses the subtraction order."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"18 يجمع المسافتين.","En":"Eighteen adds the distances."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−18 يهمل القيمة المطلقة للأول.","En":"−18 ignores the first absolute value."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القيمة المطلقة مسافة العدد عن الصفر.

$|-a|=|a|$

1. القيمة المطلقة لـ−13 تساوي 13، ولـ5 تساوي 5.

2. $|-13|-|5|=13-5$

3. نطرح المسافة الثانية من الأولى.

$8$

$8$ بلا وحدة قياس

$8+5=13$

احسب القيم المطلقة قبل الطرح.$mw$,$mw$Absolute value is distance from zero.

$|-a|=|a|$

1. The absolute values of −13 and five are thirteen and five.

2. $|-13|-|5|=13-5$

3. Subtract the second distance from the first.

$8$

$8$ Dimensionless

$8+5=13$

Evaluate absolute values before subtraction.$mw$),
(818,1568,$mw$2CBDFEAA7CD3A2447807096A0BA1595F892A8B2532AEF61BB05D336A035C0083$mw$,$mw$043acb80abcc41e16d01c0570df6ee82$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1568,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب −3/4 + 1/2.","TitleEn":"Evaluate −3/4 + 1/2.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب −3/4 + 1/2.","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate −3/4 + 1/2.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: لجمع كسرين نحتاج إلى مقام مشترك، ثم نجمع البسطين مع إبقاء المقام. المقامان 4 و2؛ نكتب 1/2 = 2/4. إذن −3/4 + 1/2 = −3/4 + 2/4 = (−3 + 2)/4 = −1/4. الإشارة سالبة لأن البسط الناتج −1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Add fractions by converting to a common denominator and adding their numerators. Here use denominator 4: 1/2 = 2/4. Then −3/4 + 1/2 = −3/4 + 2/4 = (−3 + 2)/4 = −1/4. The final numerator is negative, so the result is −1/4.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6261,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"1/4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6262,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"−5/4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6263,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"−1/4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6264,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"−1/2","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"وحّد المقام قبل الجمع.","En":"Use a common denominator before adding."},{"Ar":"حوّل النصف إلى أرباع ثم اجمع البسطين بإشارتيهما.","En":"Convert the half to fourths, then add the signed numerators."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب −3/4 + 1/2.","En":"Evaluate −3/4 + 1/2."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"1/4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/4 يعكس الإشارة.","En":"1/4 reverses the sign."}},{"LatexCode":"−5/4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5/4 يطرح النصف بدلاً من جمعه.","En":"−5/4 subtracts the half rather than adding it."}},{"LatexCode":"−1/4","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"−1/2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1/2 ليس مجموع البسطين على أربعة.","En":"−1/2 is not the sum of the numerators over four."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب −3/4 + 1/2.","En":"Evaluate −3/4 + 1/2."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات مع مراعاة الإشارات.","En":"Add fractions with a common denominator and preserve signs."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نوحد المقام إلى أربعة بتحويل النصف إلى 2/4.","En":"Use denominator four by converting one half to 2/4."},{"Ar":"$\\frac{-3+2}{4}$","En":"$\\frac{-3+2}{4}$"},{"Ar":"نجمع البسطين بإشارتيهما ونبقي المقام.","En":"Add signed numerators and keep the denominator."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-1/4$","En":"$-1/4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع المقامات.","En":"Do not add denominators."},"FormulaLatex":"-\\frac34+\\frac12=-\\frac34+\\frac24","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-\\frac14$","En":"$-\\frac14$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-\\frac14-\\frac12=-\\frac34$","En":"$-\\frac14-\\frac12=-\\frac34$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":308,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"وحّد المقام قبل الجمع.","En":"Use a common denominator before adding."},{"Ar":"حوّل النصف إلى أرباع ثم اجمع البسطين بإشارتيهما.","En":"Convert the half to fourths, then add the signed numerators."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات مع مراعاة الإشارات.","En":"Add fractions with a common denominator and preserve signs."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نوحد المقام إلى أربعة بتحويل النصف إلى 2/4.","En":"Use denominator four by converting one half to 2/4."},{"Ar":"$\\frac{-3+2}{4}$","En":"$\\frac{-3+2}{4}$"},{"Ar":"نجمع البسطين بإشارتيهما ونبقي المقام.","En":"Add signed numerators and keep the denominator."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-1/4$","En":"$-1/4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع المقامات.","En":"Do not add denominators."},"FormulaLatex":"-\\frac34+\\frac12=-\\frac34+\\frac24","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-\\frac14$","En":"$-\\frac14$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-\\frac14-\\frac12=-\\frac34$","En":"$-\\frac14-\\frac12=-\\frac34$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/4 يعكس الإشارة.","En":"1/4 reverses the sign."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5/4 يطرح النصف بدلاً من جمعه.","En":"−5/4 subtracts the half rather than adding it."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1/2 ليس مجموع البسطين على أربعة.","En":"−1/2 is not the sum of the numerators over four."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نجمع الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات مع مراعاة الإشارات.

$-\frac34+\frac12=-\frac34+\frac24$

1. نوحد المقام إلى أربعة بتحويل النصف إلى 2/4.

2. $\frac{-3+2}{4}$

3. نجمع البسطين بإشارتيهما ونبقي المقام.

$-\frac14$

$-1/4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$-\frac14-\frac12=-\frac34$

لا تجمع المقامات.$mw$,$mw$Add fractions with a common denominator and preserve signs.

$-\frac34+\frac12=-\frac34+\frac24$

1. Use denominator four by converting one half to 2/4.

2. $\frac{-3+2}{4}$

3. Add signed numerators and keep the denominator.

$-\frac14$

$-1/4$ Dimensionless

$-\frac14-\frac12=-\frac34$

Do not add denominators.$mw$),
(819,1569,$mw$F2E0A21A99996ACF8DEA2E6F29D4BDCCF1FFEC6ADCEBB0732782623747AB6AE1$mw$,$mw$937da88e8431a1d7b5de99ce1e4cd4d5$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1569,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب −5/6 − 1/3.","TitleEn":"Evaluate −5/6 − 1/3.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب −5/6 − 1/3.","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate −5/6 − 1/3.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: عند طرح كسور ذات مقامات مختلفة نوحّد المقامات أولاً، ثم نطرح البسطين. لدينا −5/6 − 1/3، ونحوّل 1/3 إلى 2/6. بالتعويض: (−5 − 2)/6 = −7/6. يمكن التحقق تقريبياً: −0.833... − 0.333... = −1.166... وهو −7/6.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Subtract rational fractions by rewriting them over a common denominator. Since 1/3 = 2/6, we have −5/6 − 1/3 = −5/6 − 2/6 = (−5 − 2)/6 = −7/6. The negative result is less than −5/6, which checks the sign.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6265,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"−5/6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6266,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"−7/6","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6267,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"−1/2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6268,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"7/6","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل الثلث إلى أسداس.","En":"Convert thirds to sixths."},{"Ar":"اطرح البسط الثاني من البسط السالب بعد توحيد المقام.","En":"Subtract the second numerator from the negative numerator over the common denominator."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب −5/6 − 1/3.","En":"Evaluate −5/6 − 1/3."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"−5/6","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5/6 يهمل طرح الثلث.","En":"−5/6 omits subtracting the third."}},{"LatexCode":"−7/6","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"−1/2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1/2 يجمع الثلث بدلاً من طرحه.","En":"−1/2 adds the third instead of subtracting it."}},{"LatexCode":"7/6","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7/6 يعكس الإشارة.","En":"7/6 reverses the sign."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب −5/6 − 1/3.","En":"Evaluate −5/6 − 1/3."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نطرح الكسور بعد توحيد المقام.","En":"Subtract fractions after finding a common denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحول الثلث إلى 2/6.","En":"Convert the third to 2/6."},{"Ar":"$\\frac{-5-2}{6}$","En":"$\\frac{-5-2}{6}$"},{"Ar":"نطرح 2 من −5 ونبقي المقام 6.","En":"Subtract two from −5 and keep denominator six."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-7/6$","En":"$-7/6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"طرح موجب من سالب يجعله أصغر.","En":"Subtracting a positive from a negative makes it smaller."},"FormulaLatex":"-\\frac56-\\frac13=-\\frac56-\\frac26","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-\\frac76$","En":"$-\\frac76$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-\\frac76+\\frac13=-\\frac56$","En":"$-\\frac76+\\frac13=-\\frac56$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":308,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل الثلث إلى أسداس.","En":"Convert thirds to sixths."},{"Ar":"اطرح البسط الثاني من البسط السالب بعد توحيد المقام.","En":"Subtract the second numerator from the negative numerator over the common denominator."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نطرح الكسور بعد توحيد المقام.","En":"Subtract fractions after finding a common denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحول الثلث إلى 2/6.","En":"Convert the third to 2/6."},{"Ar":"$\\frac{-5-2}{6}$","En":"$\\frac{-5-2}{6}$"},{"Ar":"نطرح 2 من −5 ونبقي المقام 6.","En":"Subtract two from −5 and keep denominator six."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-7/6$","En":"$-7/6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"طرح موجب من سالب يجعله أصغر.","En":"Subtracting a positive from a negative makes it smaller."},"FormulaLatex":"-\\frac56-\\frac13=-\\frac56-\\frac26","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-\\frac76$","En":"$-\\frac76$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-\\frac76+\\frac13=-\\frac56$","En":"$-\\frac76+\\frac13=-\\frac56$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5/6 يهمل طرح الثلث.","En":"−5/6 omits subtracting the third."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1/2 يجمع الثلث بدلاً من طرحه.","En":"−1/2 adds the third instead of subtracting it."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7/6 يعكس الإشارة.","En":"7/6 reverses the sign."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نطرح الكسور بعد توحيد المقام.

$-\frac56-\frac13=-\frac56-\frac26$

1. نحول الثلث إلى 2/6.

2. $\frac{-5-2}{6}$

3. نطرح 2 من −5 ونبقي المقام 6.

$-\frac76$

$-7/6$ بلا وحدة قياس

$-\frac76+\frac13=-\frac56$

طرح موجب من سالب يجعله أصغر.$mw$,$mw$Subtract fractions after finding a common denominator.

$-\frac56-\frac13=-\frac56-\frac26$

1. Convert the third to 2/6.

2. $\frac{-5-2}{6}$

3. Subtract two from −5 and keep denominator six.

$-\frac76$

$-7/6$ Dimensionless

$-\frac76+\frac13=-\frac56$

Subtracting a positive from a negative makes it smaller.$mw$),
(820,1570,$mw$7680D8C943F8238CD863B19436E344AC681ED4BEDF66DDA754FDB61787708A73$mw$,$mw$e1cf77035ecff7f8801133127a41f222$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1570,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":83,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما ناتج −2.5 + 1.75؟","TitleEn":"What is −2.5 + 1.75?","QuestionTextAr":"ما ناتج −2.5 + 1.75؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is −2.5 + 1.75?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: لجمع عددين عشريين مختلفي الإشارة نطرح القيمة المطلقة الأصغر من الأكبر ونأخذ إشارة الأكبر. العددان −2.50 و+1.75؛ نحسب 2.50 − 1.75 = 0.75. لأن 2.50 أكبر من 1.75 ومصاحب لإشارة سالبة، تكون النتيجة −0.75.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: When adding signed decimals with opposite signs, subtract their magnitudes and use the sign of the larger magnitude. Align decimal places: 2.50 − 1.75 = 0.75. Since |−2.50| > |+1.75|, the sum −2.50 + 1.75 = −0.75.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6269,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0.75","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6270,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"−1.25","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6271,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"−4.25","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6272,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"−0.75","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن القيم المطلقة أولاً.","En":"Compare absolute values first."},{"Ar":"وحّد المنازل العشرية واطرح الأصغر مطلقاً من الأكبر.","En":"Align decimal places and subtract the smaller magnitude from the larger."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما ناتج −2.5 + 1.75؟","En":"What is −2.5 + 1.75?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0.75","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0.75 يهمل الإشارة السالبة.","En":"0.75 omits the negative sign."}},{"LatexCode":"−1.25","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1.25 ليس فرق المقدارين الصحيح.","En":"−1.25 is not the correct magnitude difference."}},{"LatexCode":"−4.25","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−4.25 يجمع المقدارين رغم اختلاف الإشارتين.","En":"−4.25 adds magnitudes despite opposite signs."}},{"LatexCode":"−0.75","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما ناتج −2.5 + 1.75؟","En":"What is −2.5 + 1.75?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الأعداد ذات الإشارتين المختلفتين بطرح القيم المطلقة وإعطاء إشارة الأكبر مطلقاً.","En":"For opposite signs, subtract magnitudes and use the sign of the larger magnitude."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القيمة المطلقة لـ−2.5 أكبر من 1.75.","En":"The magnitude of −2.5 is larger than 1.75."},{"Ar":"$2.50-1.75=0.75$","En":"$2.50-1.75=0.75$"},{"Ar":"نطرح القيمتين المطلقتين بعد توحيد المنازل ونأخذ الإشارة السالبة.","En":"Subtract aligned magnitudes and use the negative sign."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-0.75$","En":"$-0.75$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"وحّد المنازل وحافظ على الإشارة.","En":"Align decimal places and preserve the sign."},"FormulaLatex":"-2.50+1.75=-(2.50-1.75)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-0.75$","En":"$-0.75$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-0.75-1.75=-2.50$","En":"$-0.75-1.75=-2.50$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":83,"PrimarySkillId":308,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن القيم المطلقة أولاً.","En":"Compare absolute values first."},{"Ar":"وحّد المنازل العشرية واطرح الأصغر مطلقاً من الأكبر.","En":"Align decimal places and subtract the smaller magnitude from the larger."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الأعداد ذات الإشارتين المختلفتين بطرح القيم المطلقة وإعطاء إشارة الأكبر مطلقاً.","En":"For opposite signs, subtract magnitudes and use the sign of the larger magnitude."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القيمة المطلقة لـ−2.5 أكبر من 1.75.","En":"The magnitude of −2.5 is larger than 1.75."},{"Ar":"$2.50-1.75=0.75$","En":"$2.50-1.75=0.75$"},{"Ar":"نطرح القيمتين المطلقتين بعد توحيد المنازل ونأخذ الإشارة السالبة.","En":"Subtract aligned magnitudes and use the negative sign."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-0.75$","En":"$-0.75$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"وحّد المنازل وحافظ على الإشارة.","En":"Align decimal places and preserve the sign."},"FormulaLatex":"-2.50+1.75=-(2.50-1.75)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$-0.75$","En":"$-0.75$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-0.75-1.75=-2.50$","En":"$-0.75-1.75=-2.50$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0.75 يهمل الإشارة السالبة.","En":"0.75 omits the negative sign."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1.25 ليس فرق المقدارين الصحيح.","En":"−1.25 is not the correct magnitude difference."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−4.25 يجمع المقدارين رغم اختلاف الإشارتين.","En":"−4.25 adds magnitudes despite opposite signs."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نجمع الأعداد ذات الإشارتين المختلفتين بطرح القيم المطلقة وإعطاء إشارة الأكبر مطلقاً.

$-2.50+1.75=-(2.50-1.75)$

